@startuml
title Part 2 - Commit Tags Fetch (Sequence)

actor User
participant "Trace UI" as UI
participant "CommitController" as CC
participant "CommitService" as CS
participant "Azure DevOps Git API" as GitAPI

User -> UI: From batch result, request tag context
UI -> CC: GET /commits/tags/batch?commitIds=...&repositoryName=...&project=...
CC -> CS: getTagsByCommitBatch(query)
CS -> GitAPI: Fetch branches/tags for each commit
GitAPI --> CS: Tag and branch references
CS --> CC: BatchTagsResponseDTO
CC --> UI: Commit tag context payload
UI --> User: Show before/after/exact tag positions

@enduml
